{
 "encounter_id": "00554",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "FAMILY_MEMBER"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right shoulder's still playing up. Thought I'd better come back."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Right, let's see where we are with it. Is it the same pain as before, or has anything changed?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Same. The pain in my shoulder catches when I reach up."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And how long has it been going on this time round?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Three weeks. About that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Oh, it's longer than that, love. You were rubbing it at the barbecue and that was ages ago. Six weeks, easily."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Was it? Felt like three."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "All right, so somewhere between three and six weeks. What makes it worse?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Lifting. Overhead stuff, mostly."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anything that eases it? Heat, resting it, tablets?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Paracetamol takes the edge off. Nothing else."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay. Last time you also had that tingling in your fingers. Where's that got to?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Gone. Settled a while back."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you remember when it first started?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No idea, honestly. It was just there one day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Don't ask me. He never says a word until it's a problem."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Fair enough. Any fall or knock to the shoulder in the meantime?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any chest pain, or pain travelling up into the jaw?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Nope. Nothing like that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. What are you taking at the moment? Include anything from the chemist."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ramipril, 5 milligrams once a day, for my high blood pressure. Paracetamol when it's bad. And the omeprazole."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What strength is the omeprazole?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "20 milligrams. Every morning."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any allergies to medicines that I should know about?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "None that I know of, and I'd know by now."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Have you had any operations in the past?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Appendix. About twenty years ago."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And does anything run in the family where shoulders are concerned?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My dad had a frozen shoulder. Round about my age."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Right. Sit still for me and I'll do your blood pressure and pulse."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "134 over 82, and your pulse is 72. Perfectly acceptable.",
   "pause": 16
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Now lift that arm out to the side for me, nice and slow. Keep going up. There, you catch halfway. That's a painful arc as the arm comes out sideways.",
   "pause": 8
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yeah. That's the spot."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "So, options. We can do an X-ray, we can do an ultrasound scan, or we can stick with exercises and wait. What would you rather?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Whichever's quickest."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Then let's get a shoulder X-ray booked for this week, and reception will ring you with the time."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If it's still sore after the X-ray and a fortnight of exercises, we might do an ultrasound scan on top. Not before."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "In the meantime, no heavy lifting above shoulder height, and go through the exercise sheet twice a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'll make sure he does them."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'll manage, thanks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Mind that shoulder on the way out, and don't let the door swing back on it."
  }
 ],
